{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become an unstoppable ball of destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your dung ball from the fearsome Arachnant horde - an unrelenting onslaught of ant enemies. Build out your ultimate arsenal by upgrading different weapon parts to suit your gameplay style, fight through the levels of the enemy nest, and satisfy all your destructive needs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823160/extras/GungBeetleGunBall2.png?t=1744676799\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Just So Many Guns</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every gun is built using 4 customisable components: The Barrel, The Core, The Clip and the Bullets.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match all different parts to try and create impossible and devastating combos.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly 500 parts across 6 different manufactures enabling millions of cursed combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823160/extras/ezgif.com-effects__1_.gif?t=1744676799\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want dual rotating barrels with armour piercing vampire rounds while launching charged plasma on reload? hell yeah, why not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different gun manufactures will supply you with weapon components to assist a run, each offering unique parts with powerful modifiers enabling you to tailor your guns to your preferred style of play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823160/extras/ArachnicsImage.png?t=1744676799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823160/extras/NovaImage.png?t=1744676799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823160/extras/webImage.png?t=1744676799\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Twin-stick physics based controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip different balls to gain the upper hand and unlock special movement mechanics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast yourself forward with the cannon ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump over enemies with the golf ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run rings around the enemy with the carbon race ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform deadly science with the demon ball.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meta progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build out the inside of the ball 'RTS' style to boost production of advanced weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24 customisable build slots to add new weapon parts and manufacturers, or fill it with XP magnets and XP efficiency boosters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new factories and upgrade existing ones to become more powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free flies during runs to boost build efficiency and gain aerial support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823160/extras/innerBall.gif?t=1744676799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2823160?t=1744676799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744676799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823160/11f515aed316acfe66fa4a350b1ee918f73942fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744676799","ca